        "liquid": "<section class=\"df-reviews-section\">\n<div class=\"df-reviews-header\">\n<p class=\"df-reviews-kicker\">Avis clients</p>\n<h2>Ils ont essayé, ils ne peuvent plus s’en passer.</h2>\n<p>Des clients partagent comment Déclic Focus les aide à mieux travailler, mieux s’organiser et rester concentrés.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"df-reviews-wrapper\">\n<button class=\"df-review-arrow df-review-prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Avis précédent\">‹</button>\n<div class=\"df-reviews-slider\" id=\"dfReviewsSlider\">\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-13.png?v=1788358203\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Maman, 2 enfants</h3><p>“Avec Déclic Focus, les devoirs sont devenus plus simples : moins de conflits, plus de concentration.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-11.png?v=1788358203\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Étudiante en droit</h3><p>“Les applis Pomodoro ne marchaient pas pour moi. Avec un vrai minuteur physique, je reste enfin concentrée.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-09.png?v=1788358203\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Entrepreneur freelance</h3><p>“Déclic Focus m’a remis un vrai cadre : sessions claires, vraies pauses et beaucoup moins de charge mentale.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-10.png?v=1788358203\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Télétravailleuse</h3><p>“Depuis que je lance le minuteur, j’avance beaucoup plus vite sur les tâches importantes.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/71XNXN4qcLL_b2279a5d-22b8-4b57-a405-2281d2d1751a.jpg?v=1788392837\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Papa, enfant en CE2</h3><p>“On a commencé par de petites sessions. Maintenant, mon fils tient beaucoup plus longtemps.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-07.png?v=1788357916\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Étudiant en médecine</h3><p>“Sans écran ni notification, c’est beaucoup plus facile de tenir mes sessions de révision.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-03.png?v=1788357915\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Consultante indépendante</h3><p>“Je pose le minuteur, je bosse, il sonne, je m’arrête. Simple, mais vraiment efficace.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-06.png?v=1788357915\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Maman solo</h3><p>“Le minuteur m’aide à protéger des créneaux courts mais efficaces, sans téléphone.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-01.png?v=1788357915\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Étudiant en prépa</h3><p>“Avoir un objet physique, sans lien avec mon smartphone, m’aide vraiment à décrocher.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-02..png?v=1788357916\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Entrepreneur e-commerce</h3><p>“Je papillonnais entre les tâches. Maintenant, je traite une chose à la fois.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-04.png?v=1788357915\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Fondatrice de startup</h3><p>“Déclic Focus m’aide à bloquer de vrais créneaux de travail profond.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-05.png?v=1788357914\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Entrepreneur solo</h3><p>“Ce qui change, c’est que ce n’est pas une appli de plus. C’est un vrai objet sur mon bureau.”</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"df-review-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1025/6842/7903/files/avis-08.png?v=1788357833\" alt=\"Avis client Déclic Focus\"><div class=\"df-review-content\"><div class=\"df-review-stars\">★★★★★</div><h3>Agence de communication</h3><p>“Il est minimaliste, soigné, et c’est devenu un vrai repère dans mon organisation.”</p></div></article>\n</div>\n<button class=\"df-review-arrow df-review-next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Avis suivant\">›</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.df-reviews-section{width:100%;padding:74px 0 78px;background:radial-gradient(circle at top left,rgba(37,99,235,0.22),transparent 34%),linear-gradient(135deg,#061528 0%,#0B2447 52%,#123A63 100%);overflow:hidden;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}\n.df-reviews-header{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto 42px;padding:0 20px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF}\n.df-reviews-kicker{display:inline-flex;margin:0 0 14px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);color:#67E8F9;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.df-reviews-header h2{margin:0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,58px);line-height:1.02;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.8px}\n.df-reviews-header p:not(.df-reviews-kicker){margin:16px auto 0;max-width:720px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.76);font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500}\n.df-reviews-wrapper{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:1380px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px}\n.df-reviews-slider{display:flex;gap:22px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-padding-left:4px;padding:8px 4px 26px;scrollbar-width:none}\n.df-reviews-slider::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.df-review-card{width:325px;min-width:325px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px;background:#FFFFFF;box-shadow:0 26px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.32);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.46);flex-shrink:0;scroll-snap-align:start}\n.df-review-card img{width:100%;height:285px;display:block;object-fit:cover;background:#E5E7EB}\n.df-review-content{padding:20px 20px 22px}\n.df-review-stars{margin-bottom:10px;color:#00B67A;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:1.5px;line-height:1}\n.df-review-content h3{margin:0 0 10px;color:#071827;font-size:17px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.35px}\n.df-review-content p{margin:0;color:#243244;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500}\n.df-review-arrow{position:absolute;top:46%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:5;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.96);color:#0B2447;font-size:36px;line-height:1;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);transition:transform 0.2s ease,background 0.2s ease}\n.df-review-arrow:hover{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(1.06);background:#FFFFFF}\n.df-review-prev{left:14px}\n.df-review-next{right:14px}\n@media screen and (max-width:749px){\n.df-reviews-section{padding:54px 0 58px}\n.df-reviews-header{margin-bottom:28px;padding:0 18px}\n.df-reviews-header h2{font-size:33px;letter-spacing:-1.2px}\n.df-reviews-header p:not(.df-reviews-kicker){font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45}\n.df-reviews-wrapper{padding:0 16px}\n.df-reviews-slider{gap:16px;padding-bottom:22px;scroll-padding-left:4px}\n.df-review-card{width:275px;min-width:275px;border-radius:20px}\n.df-review-card img{height:240px}\n.df-review-content{padding:18px 18px 20px}\n.df-review-content h3{font-size:15.5px}\n.df-review-content p{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.48}\n.df-review-arrow{width:38px;height:38px;font-size:28px;top:52%}\n.df-review-prev{left:4px}\n.df-review-next{right:4px}\n}\n</style>\n<script>\n(function(){\nfunction initDfReviewsSlider(){\nvar slider=document.getElementById(\"dfReviewsSlider\");\nvar prev=document.querySelector(\".df-review-prev\");\nvar next=document.querySelector(\".df-review-next\");\nif(!slider||!prev||!next)return;\nif(slider.dataset.dfInit===\"true\")return;\nslider.dataset.dfInit=\"true\";\nslider.innerHTML+=slider.innerHTML;\nvar isPaused=false,isManualScrolling=false;\nfunction getCards(){return Array.from(slider.querySelectorAll(\".df-review-card\"));}\nfunction getCardLeft(card){return card.offsetLeft-slider.offsetLeft;}\nfunction getClosestCardIndex(){var cards=getCards(),ci=0,cd=Infinity;cards.forEach(function(card,i){var d=Math.abs(slider.scrollLeft-getCardLeft(card));if(d<cd){cd=d;ci=i;}});return ci;}\nfunction scrollToCard(index){var cards=getCards();if(!cards.length)return;if(index<0){index=Math.floor(cards.length/2)-1;slider.scrollLeft=getCardLeft(cards[Math.floor(cards.length/2)]);}if(index>=cards.length){index=0;}isManualScrolling=true;slider.scrollTo({left:getCardLeft(cards[index]),behavior:\"smooth\"});setTimeout(function(){isManualScrolling=false;},700);}\nfunction pauseThenResume(){isPaused=true;setTimeout(function(){isPaused=false;},1800);}\nfunction autoMove(){if(!isPaused&&!isManualScrolling){slider.scrollLeft+=0.6;if(slider.scrollLeft>=slider.scrollWidth/2){slider.scrollLeft=0;}}requestAnimationFrame(autoMove);}\nnext.addEventListener(\"click\",function(){var c=getClosestCardIndex();pauseThenResume();scrollToCard(c+1);});\nprev.addEventListener(\"click\",function(){var c=getClosestCardIndex();pauseThenResume();scrollToCard(c-1);});\nslider.addEventListener(\"mouseenter\",function(){isPaused=true;});\nslider.addEventListener(\"mouseleave\",function(){isPaused=false;});\nslider.addEventListener(\"touchstart\",function(){isPaused=true;});\nslider.addEventListener(\"touchend\",function(){setTimeout(function(){isPaused=false;},1800);});\nautoMove();\n}\nif(document.readyState===\"loading\"){document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\",initDfReviewsSlider);}else{initDfReviewsSlider();}\ndocument.addEventListener(\"shopify:section:load\",initDfReviewsSlider);\n})();\n</script>",
